WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:36.350
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:36.620 --> 01:38.800
[The Lament of Autumn]

3
01:39.520 --> 01:41.800
[Episode 40]

4
01:42.020 --> 01:45.110
[Yu Mansion]

5
01:59.840 --> 02:00.980
Is Yu asleep?

6
02:14.130 --> 02:16.130
The stars are so beautiful tonight.

7
02:17.400 --> 02:19.329
When I was a child, my mother told me

8
02:20.560 --> 02:22.150
that every star in the sky

9
02:22.970 --> 02:24.900
corresponds to a person on earth.

10
02:26.750 --> 02:28.300
Everyone loves stars.

11
02:29.400 --> 02:30.060
Maybe it's because

12
02:30.060 --> 02:31.410
they are eternal.

13
02:32.400 --> 02:34.560
Everyone longs to be with their loved ones,

14
02:34.560 --> 02:36.780
hoping they can be like the stars

15
02:37.520 --> 02:39.850
and provide them eternal companionship.

16
02:41.630 --> 02:42.300
Pingjun.

17
02:44.840 --> 02:46.020
Will you blame me?

18
02:48.190 --> 02:49.620
After all, our family

19
02:51.020 --> 02:52.579
finally reunited.

20
03:03.000 --> 03:03.970
Changxuan.

21
03:06.590 --> 03:07.860
You must remember,

22
03:09.900 --> 03:11.530
no matter where you go,

23
03:13.300 --> 03:14.690
you are not alone.

24
03:16.810 --> 03:18.610
I will always stand by your side.

25
03:26.500 --> 03:27.430
Ye Pingjun.

26
03:28.650 --> 03:29.910
I want you to know this.

27
03:31.810 --> 03:33.300
In this war-torn land,

28
03:35.130 --> 03:36.650
amidst the storms,

29
03:39.930 --> 03:41.690
you have always been

30
03:43.530 --> 03:44.860
the only one in my heart—

31
03:46.930 --> 03:49.460
Yu Changxuan's heart— from beginning to end.

32
03:59.460 --> 04:00.360
I know.

33
04:16.430 --> 04:17.769
Yu said

34
04:18.800 --> 04:20.930
you promised to take him to Fengtai

35
04:21.800 --> 04:23.800
to see the maple leaves this autumn.

36
04:27.690 --> 04:28.800
When I come back,

37
04:30.630 --> 04:31.660
we will

38
04:32.630 --> 04:34.180
plant a maple tree for him together,

39
04:34.180 --> 04:34.770
okay?

40
04:36.659 --> 04:38.260
When the maple tree grows up,

41
04:39.540 --> 04:40.920
we can use its leaves

42
04:42.330 --> 04:43.830
as bookmarks for Yu.

43
04:45.000 --> 04:46.420
When Yu goes to school,

44
04:47.190 --> 04:48.720
they can always be with him.

45
04:52.420 --> 04:53.220
Okay.

46
04:55.500 --> 04:56.560
It's a deal.

47
04:58.250 --> 04:59.710
Don't break your promise.

48
05:02.300 --> 05:03.310
It's a deal.

49
05:16.810 --> 05:17.630
Oh, right.

50
05:19.130 --> 05:20.430
I asked the kitchen

51
05:20.510 --> 05:21.870
to boil some milk for me.

52
05:22.300 --> 05:24.560
I'll go check on it and be right back.

53
06:03.040 --> 06:05.270
It's flying!

54
06:05.830 --> 06:07.830
It's flying!

55
06:08.540 --> 06:09.510
Grandpa!

56
06:11.420 --> 06:13.270
Grandpa, hold me too.

57
06:13.540 --> 06:15.100
Okay, come here.

58
06:15.770 --> 06:16.970
Let Grandpa hold you.

59
06:17.330 --> 06:18.500
You're too heavy.

60
06:19.830 --> 06:21.500
I can hold you both,

61
06:21.810 --> 06:22.870
but how do I

62
06:22.870 --> 06:23.830
put you down?

63
06:23.830 --> 06:24.420
The sofa!

64
06:24.810 --> 06:25.980
Okay, the sofa.

65
06:36.630 --> 06:38.690
How come it's just the two of you left?

66
06:39.330 --> 06:40.310
Where are your parents?

67
06:40.310 --> 06:41.870
Mom went to see Dad off.

68
06:41.980 --> 06:43.260
Dad is leaving

69
06:43.280 --> 06:45.150
to fight the Japanese invaders.

70
06:46.270 --> 06:47.120
Grandpa, Grandpa!

71
06:47.120 --> 06:49.390
Let's play hide-and-seek, okay?

72
06:49.390 --> 06:50.190
Hide-and-seek?

73
06:50.190 --> 06:50.720
Okay.

74
06:51.120 --> 06:52.060
I'll count to ten.

75
06:52.060 --> 06:52.890
Cover your eyes.

76
06:52.890 --> 06:53.270
Okay.

77
06:53.270 --> 06:54.730
Cover your eyes and count.

78
06:54.740 --> 06:55.360
One.

79
06:57.570 --> 06:58.720
Two.

80
07:02.010 --> 07:03.220
Three.

81
07:05.330 --> 07:06.390
Four.

82
07:09.890 --> 07:11.060
Five.

83
07:13.420 --> 07:14.430
Six.

84
07:16.450 --> 07:17.390
Seven.

85
07:22.980 --> 07:23.950
Eight.

86
07:26.450 --> 07:27.560
Heavy snow today.

87
07:28.750 --> 07:29.950
A classmate asked me,

88
07:30.360 --> 07:32.390
since I was born into a wealthy family

89
07:32.390 --> 07:33.810
and enjoy all the glory and wealth,

90
07:33.810 --> 07:35.720
[If someone needs to shed their last drop of blood for this country]

91
07:34.390 --> 07:36.100
why bother coming to a foreign land

92
07:35.740 --> 07:38.180
[I, Yu Mingxuan, will gladly be the first]

93
07:36.100 --> 07:37.900
to seek a way to save the country?

94
07:38.690 --> 07:39.920
Father often says

95
07:40.620 --> 07:41.330
that we can only

96
07:41.330 --> 07:43.540
protect our family estate with an army in hand.

97
07:43.540 --> 07:44.690
But if this beautiful land

98
07:44.690 --> 07:45.659
becomes scorched earth,

99
07:45.659 --> 07:47.060
and the nation perishes,

100
07:47.250 --> 07:48.580
where will our homes be?

101
07:49.890 --> 07:50.920
One day,

102
07:51.920 --> 07:53.190
if someone needs to shed

103
07:53.190 --> 07:54.980
their last drop of blood for this country,

104
07:54.980 --> 07:57.240
I, Yu Mingxuan, will gladly be the first,

105
07:58.060 --> 07:59.659
and die without regrets.

106
08:01.190 --> 08:02.560
May future generations

107
08:02.980 --> 08:03.890
always have the right to choose

108
08:03.890 --> 08:05.180
what to live for

109
08:06.010 --> 08:08.250
and escape the fate of being slaves.

110
08:38.870 --> 08:40.130
Attention, everyone!

111
08:40.240 --> 08:41.010
At ease.

112
08:41.740 --> 08:42.460
Attention.

113
08:43.150 --> 08:44.550
Dress right, dress.

114
08:45.840 --> 08:46.980
Ready, front.

115
09:02.940 --> 09:04.150
I'll be at home

116
09:04.510 --> 09:06.250
to take care of Mom and the kids.

117
09:07.130 --> 09:08.440
Don't worry.

118
09:10.240 --> 09:11.010
Pingjun.

119
09:12.790 --> 09:13.620
If...

120
09:14.240 --> 09:15.270
There are no ifs.

121
09:25.000 --> 09:25.790
Changxuan.

122
09:27.860 --> 09:29.170
Yu and I

123
09:31.600 --> 09:33.000
will wait for you at home.

124
10:16.340 --> 10:16.720
Dad.

125
10:17.050 --> 10:17.980
Why are you here?

126
10:18.460 --> 10:19.520
Are you moving out?

127
10:23.750 --> 10:24.940
I left Wu Zuoxiao

128
10:25.320 --> 10:26.780
with a division of troops.

129
10:26.820 --> 10:28.030
If the battle is lost,

130
10:28.390 --> 10:29.720
Wu Zuoxiao will be responsible

131
10:29.720 --> 10:31.050
for escorting all the people in the city

132
10:31.050 --> 10:32.150
to take refuge in the south.

133
10:32.150 --> 10:32.740
Okay.

134
10:33.410 --> 10:34.470
Your guard company

135
10:35.100 --> 10:36.560
has also been left for you.

136
10:36.750 --> 10:37.250
No need.

137
10:42.270 --> 10:43.120
Ye Pingjun.

138
10:48.170 --> 10:49.120
Don't worry.

139
10:49.790 --> 10:52.650
Your husband is going to the battlefield this time,

140
10:52.890 --> 10:54.090
and I've got his back.

141
10:55.820 --> 10:56.410
You...

142
10:57.410 --> 10:58.470
What are you doing?

143
11:00.050 --> 11:02.250
Don't think I'm just here to see you off.

144
11:05.170 --> 11:06.790
Brothers fight tigers together,

145
11:06.790 --> 11:09.050
and father and son go to battle together.

146
11:09.550 --> 11:11.480
This battle will be very tough.

147
11:12.720 --> 11:14.100
I will fight it with you.

148
11:21.670 --> 11:22.870
Get ready to move out.

149
11:48.790 --> 11:49.500
Move out!

150
11:50.700 --> 11:51.130
Yes!

151
11:58.410 --> 11:59.260
Move out!

152
11:59.290 --> 11:59.770
Yes!

153
12:00.480 --> 12:01.250
Move out!

154
12:01.530 --> 12:02.290
Yes!

155
12:02.980 --> 12:04.110
Double time, march.

156
12:04.620 --> 12:05.150
Move out!

157
12:05.200 --> 12:05.760
Yes!

158
12:06.150 --> 12:06.790
Move out!

159
12:06.890 --> 12:07.600
Yes!

160
12:59.650 --> 13:00.250
Deputy Commander,

161
13:00.250 --> 13:02.310
Commander Xiao Beichen has arrived.

162
13:33.270 --> 13:34.200
Commander Xiao.

163
13:35.600 --> 13:37.200
I've heard so much about you.

164
13:38.820 --> 13:39.820
It's also my honor

165
13:40.100 --> 13:41.250
to meet you here at Wubeikou,

166
13:41.250 --> 13:43.050
Deputy Commander-in-Chief Yu.

167
13:45.030 --> 13:46.290
On my way here today,

168
13:47.530 --> 13:49.390
I saw many familiar troops

169
13:49.650 --> 13:51.050
heading to Wubeikou.

170
13:53.150 --> 13:54.280
In the past, to fight for territory,

171
13:54.280 --> 13:55.740
we fought bloody battles.

172
13:55.910 --> 13:57.120
Now we all know

173
13:57.580 --> 13:58.840
to turn our guns around

174
13:59.290 --> 14:00.530
and face the enemy together.

175
14:00.530 --> 14:01.730
If our country falls,

176
14:02.860 --> 14:04.410
we'll be defeated soldiers no matter

177
14:04.410 --> 14:05.240
where we go.

178
14:05.700 --> 14:06.700
So in this battle,

179
14:07.340 --> 14:08.340
we have no way out,

180
14:09.050 --> 14:10.450
and no factions among us.

181
14:12.530 --> 14:13.330
That's right.

182
14:14.790 --> 14:16.850
Standing shoulder to shoulder here,

183
14:17.000 --> 14:18.340
we all share one name:

184
14:19.890 --> 14:21.080
Chinese soldiers.

185
14:22.320 --> 14:24.080
Behind us is our homeland.

186
14:24.910 --> 14:25.910
From today on,

187
14:27.150 --> 14:27.630
we are

188
14:27.630 --> 14:29.410
comrades in the same trench.

189
14:35.500 --> 14:36.830
There's something else

190
14:39.120 --> 14:41.120
I want to put your mind at ease about.

191
14:41.770 --> 14:44.110
[To Changxuan]

192
14:44.890 --> 14:46.420
Your sixth sister, Qixuan,

193
14:46.600 --> 14:47.330
is currently

194
14:47.390 --> 14:48.360
working as a nurse

195
14:48.360 --> 14:49.890
at the rear field hospital.

196
14:49.960 --> 14:50.890
She is very safe.

197
14:52.620 --> 14:53.700
That brat Qixuan

198
14:54.600 --> 14:55.860
left without saying goodbye.

199
14:55.860 --> 14:57.650
She said she was going to find you.

200
14:57.650 --> 14:59.050
She also wrote back to me.

201
14:59.290 --> 15:00.410
I still want to thank you

202
15:00.410 --> 15:02.610
for taking care of her, Commander Xiao.

203
15:08.290 --> 15:09.350
Speaking of which,

204
15:09.620 --> 15:10.580
she was the one

205
15:11.220 --> 15:12.460
who saved my life.

206
16:35.770 --> 16:36.740
You're awake.

207
16:55.580 --> 16:56.700
Is this your wife?

208
16:58.170 --> 16:58.790
Yes.

209
17:05.960 --> 17:09.750
She is really beautiful.

210
17:21.010 --> 17:22.329
I must go back alive

211
17:23.810 --> 17:24.770
to see her.

212
17:29.960 --> 17:31.750
Then you must recover well

213
17:32.920 --> 17:34.250
and take your medicine.

214
17:34.720 --> 17:37.440
Otherwise, how can you go back to see her?

215
17:41.180 --> 17:41.750
Here.

216
17:42.250 --> 17:44.250
Let me help you change your clothes.

217
17:46.940 --> 17:47.570
No need.

218
17:47.850 --> 17:48.850
I'll do it myself.

219
17:53.270 --> 17:54.030
Okay.

220
17:55.140 --> 17:56.270
You go ahead.

221
17:56.400 --> 17:58.930
I'll go outside and brew the medicine for you.

222
17:59.900 --> 18:00.590
Thank you.

223
18:28.380 --> 18:29.140
Miss,

224
18:29.680 --> 18:30.510
are you two

225
18:30.530 --> 18:32.380
getting married soon?

226
18:37.090 --> 18:38.200
No, Ma'am.

227
18:39.180 --> 18:41.160
He has a wonderful wife

228
18:42.000 --> 18:43.330
waiting for him at home.

229
18:45.330 --> 18:47.400
Well... you...

230
18:48.310 --> 18:48.980
Ma'am,

231
18:49.900 --> 18:51.400
I'm really happy.

232
18:51.720 --> 18:53.380
I'm so happy he's still alive.

233
18:54.500 --> 18:55.740
I just feel that

234
18:58.460 --> 18:59.920
everything is beautiful.

235
19:01.400 --> 19:02.500
It's all worth it.

236
19:10.050 --> 19:10.720
Qixuan knew

237
19:10.740 --> 19:12.600
I was leading troops to Wubeikou,

238
19:13.050 --> 19:15.050
so she asked me to send you a message.

239
19:16.330 --> 19:17.140
She told me,

240
19:18.660 --> 19:20.700
"You'll definitely see my brother, Changxuan,

241
19:20.700 --> 19:21.900
and he'll definitely

242
19:22.090 --> 19:24.090
lead troops to fight the Japanese."

243
19:24.750 --> 19:26.280
She also asked me to tell you

244
19:27.110 --> 19:28.510
that she is fighting too,

245
19:29.310 --> 19:31.310
and hasn't disgraced the Yu family.

246
19:41.010 --> 19:41.770
Thank you.

247
19:57.980 --> 19:58.710
Work harder!

248
19:59.050 --> 19:59.780
Tamp it down!

249
20:01.610 --> 20:02.610
This side is done!

250
20:03.290 --> 20:04.220
Good job, brothers!

251
20:04.220 --> 20:05.350
The situation is dire.

252
20:05.350 --> 20:06.610
We need to work harder!

253
20:06.790 --> 20:07.270
Yes!

254
20:08.290 --> 20:09.110
Work harder!

255
20:14.400 --> 20:15.140
Hurry up!

256
20:15.420 --> 20:16.330
Faster!

257
20:16.480 --> 20:17.380
Dig deeper!

258
20:47.380 --> 20:48.220
Take cover!

259
20:48.220 --> 20:49.330
Hide!

260
20:51.090 --> 20:51.770
Spread out!

261
20:56.750 --> 20:58.110
Get down!

262
21:07.240 --> 21:08.250
Reporting, Commander.

263
21:08.250 --> 21:09.380
Dongyukou can't hold out any longer.

264
21:09.380 --> 21:10.710
What do you mean by that?

265
21:11.000 --> 21:13.000
They have all been killed in action.

266
21:14.530 --> 21:15.220
Got it.

267
21:20.750 --> 21:21.310
Father.

268
21:24.740 --> 21:27.000
I'm going to the Dongyukou command post.

269
21:27.550 --> 21:28.440
You're going?

270
21:31.160 --> 21:31.660
I am.

271
21:34.000 --> 21:34.600
All right.

272
21:53.510 --> 21:54.240
Take it.

273
21:55.530 --> 21:56.270
Take it.

274
21:56.680 --> 21:57.810
Go back and buy some supplies.

275
21:57.810 --> 21:58.740
Live a good life.

276
21:59.140 --> 22:00.340
Here, take it.

277
22:02.050 --> 22:02.960
This is

278
22:03.380 --> 22:04.530
double the severance pay

279
22:04.530 --> 22:06.310
for each of you.

280
22:06.920 --> 22:08.660
It's enough for you to go home,

281
22:09.390 --> 22:11.230
buy a few acres of land,

282
22:11.380 --> 22:13.180
and cover your travel expenses.

283
22:15.440 --> 22:16.200
Madam.

284
22:16.500 --> 22:17.460
-Madam! -Madam!

285
22:17.460 --> 22:19.260
-Madam! -Madam!

286
22:19.400 --> 22:22.070
Everyone, please don't cry.

287
22:22.570 --> 22:24.090
The Yu family is grateful

288
22:25.570 --> 22:27.780
for your service all these years.

289
22:28.960 --> 22:30.290
No matter how hard it is,

290
22:30.850 --> 22:32.850
you must live on well.

291
22:34.810 --> 22:35.920
Get up.

292
22:37.250 --> 22:37.990
Madam...

293
22:45.250 --> 22:46.160
Let's go...

294
22:52.350 --> 22:53.250
Wu Zuoxiao.

295
22:54.660 --> 22:55.270
Here.

296
22:59.440 --> 23:00.700
All this gold

297
23:00.810 --> 23:02.790
will be used as army pay.

298
23:03.180 --> 23:03.880
And tell

299
23:03.880 --> 23:06.280
the Yu family soldiers on the battlefield

300
23:06.570 --> 23:08.050
that even if our Yu family's

301
23:08.050 --> 23:10.140
treasury is completely empty,

302
23:10.270 --> 23:12.330
we will never leave the Japanese

303
23:12.330 --> 23:13.830
a single cent.

304
23:14.510 --> 23:16.180
You are truly righteous, Madam.

305
23:16.180 --> 23:18.180
On behalf of all the soldiers,

306
23:18.290 --> 23:19.640
I thank you, Madam.

307
23:24.100 --> 23:26.730
[Yu Mansion]

308
23:29.740 --> 23:32.960
[Yu Mansion]

309
23:45.020 --> 23:53.370
[Yu Mansion]

310
24:02.910 --> 24:03.610
Madam,

311
24:03.770 --> 24:05.630
we have arrived at Linchuan Town.

312
24:33.290 --> 24:34.140
I didn't expect the Japanese soldiers

313
24:34.140 --> 24:35.720
to enter Nanhuai so quickly.

314
24:35.720 --> 24:36.650
What a disaster.

315
24:36.830 --> 24:38.520
I heard it's to catch Madam Yu.

316
24:38.550 --> 24:39.630
On the way,

317
24:39.770 --> 24:40.720
they caught some servants

318
24:40.720 --> 24:42.790
of Yu's Residence who couldn't leave the city in time,

319
24:42.790 --> 24:45.010
to interrogate them about Madam Yu's whereabouts.

320
24:45.010 --> 24:47.210
Who knows how many more people will die.

321
24:51.050 --> 24:51.900
Stop the car.

322
24:55.160 --> 24:55.750
Madam.

323
24:56.160 --> 24:58.420
We haven't reached the ferry crossing yet.

324
24:58.420 --> 24:59.770
Give me paper and a pen.

325
25:06.310 --> 25:09.730
[Linchuan Ferry]

326
25:15.510 --> 25:20.500
[Linchuan Ferry]

327
25:29.410 --> 25:30.480
Fifth Young Madam.

328
25:30.700 --> 25:31.420
Nanny Zhu.

329
25:34.920 --> 25:35.720
Madam asked me

330
25:36.980 --> 25:38.550
to give this to you.

331
25:37.760 --> 25:41.080
[To Pingjun]

332
25:40.840 --> 25:41.640
She said

333
25:41.900 --> 25:43.350
you must get on the boat

334
25:43.830 --> 25:45.430
and not wait a single moment.

335
25:57.070 --> 25:59.780
[To Pingjun]

336
25:59.900 --> 26:09.580
[Vision and Wisdom Beyond Measure]

337
26:15.880 --> 26:16.880
Since

338
26:17.310 --> 26:19.140
none of you are willing to tell me

339
26:18.610 --> 26:20.830
[Vision and Wisdom Beyond Measure]

340
26:19.420 --> 26:21.000
where your madam is,

341
26:21.440 --> 26:23.870
I shall honor your loyalty.

342
26:23.980 --> 26:24.660
Ready!

343
26:25.050 --> 26:25.790
Do it!

344
26:25.880 --> 26:26.770
Stop!

345
26:30.110 --> 26:33.620
[Yu Mansion]

346
26:42.200 --> 26:42.830
Madam!

347
26:43.030 --> 26:44.170
Why are you back?

348
26:44.510 --> 26:45.920
Madam! Madam!

349
26:45.920 --> 26:48.460
Get down! Get down!

350
26:51.960 --> 26:52.920
Madam Yu,

351
26:53.660 --> 26:55.980
you are indeed a heroine.

352
27:09.250 --> 27:12.290
Madam Yu, as long as you sign this

353
27:12.590 --> 27:13.920
and broadcast

354
27:14.000 --> 27:16.250
an appeal for the Yu Army to surrender,

355
27:16.810 --> 27:19.400
I will guarantee their safety.

356
27:19.700 --> 27:21.120
I can stay.

357
27:21.290 --> 27:22.240
Let them go.

358
27:22.610 --> 27:23.400
Madam!

359
27:23.420 --> 27:24.500
-Madam! -Madam!

360
27:25.030 --> 27:26.090
-Madam! -Madam!

361
27:26.400 --> 27:29.980
What makes you think you can negotiate with me?

362
27:30.110 --> 27:32.110
If my guess is correct,

363
27:32.790 --> 27:34.250
you want me to come forward

364
27:34.400 --> 27:36.570
to persuade my husband and children.

365
27:36.740 --> 27:39.070
If you want a living bargaining chip,

366
27:39.160 --> 27:40.530
you have to listen to me.

367
27:50.900 --> 27:52.310
Release them all.

368
27:54.880 --> 27:55.510
Madam!

369
27:55.790 --> 27:56.680
Stop kneeling.

370
27:56.680 --> 27:57.720
We won't leave.

371
27:57.750 --> 27:59.180
Stop kneeling. Get up.

372
28:00.740 --> 28:01.270
Get up!

373
28:01.330 --> 28:02.190
We won't leave.

374
28:03.110 --> 28:05.400
Get up quickly. Leave!

375
28:05.900 --> 28:07.040
Leave!

376
28:07.160 --> 28:07.680
Madam!

377
28:07.680 --> 28:08.090
Leave!

378
28:08.400 --> 28:10.400
Listen to Madam! Get up and leave!

379
28:10.550 --> 28:11.310
Madam...

380
28:12.070 --> 28:12.960
Madam...

381
28:18.850 --> 28:19.740
Madam...

382
28:28.940 --> 28:29.770
Madam Yu.

383
28:31.240 --> 28:32.220
Please.

384
28:43.000 --> 28:44.310
Captain Takahashi.

385
28:44.900 --> 28:47.030
You don't understand Chinese rules.

386
28:47.750 --> 28:48.450
Doing such a thing

387
28:48.450 --> 28:50.270
that betrays our ancestors

388
28:50.270 --> 28:52.290
means going to hell after death.

389
28:52.700 --> 28:54.160
Before signing,

390
28:54.700 --> 28:56.560
I need to go to the ancestral hall,

391
28:56.720 --> 28:59.480
kneel and confess to my ancestors,

392
28:59.640 --> 29:01.550
and beg for their forgiveness.

393
29:07.530 --> 29:09.160
The ancestral hall is a sacred place.

394
29:09.160 --> 29:10.500
Outsiders entering

395
29:11.140 --> 29:12.800
might disturb the ancestors.

396
29:14.700 --> 29:18.460
Then I will personally accompany you, Madam,

397
29:18.740 --> 29:22.310
to pay my respects to the Yu family ancestors.

398
29:30.690 --> 29:34.840
[Bring Honor to Your Ancestors and Bless Your Descendants]

399
29:59.380 --> 30:01.240
Ancestors above,

400
30:01.740 --> 30:04.000
I, your unworthy descendant Zhao Baoru,

401
30:04.500 --> 30:06.330
confess my sins here.

402
30:21.310 --> 30:24.710
Foreign enemies have invaded, and the country is shattered.

403
30:25.070 --> 30:28.850
I failed to protect Nanhuai,

404
30:29.610 --> 30:33.090
allowing the enemy to trample on the ancestral hall.

405
30:33.980 --> 30:35.720
This constitutes one offense.

406
30:41.250 --> 30:43.110
The enemy used threats and bribes

407
30:44.050 --> 30:47.310
to make me surrender and betray my country.

408
30:48.070 --> 30:49.730
It brings shame to our family.

409
30:51.000 --> 30:52.870
I, Baoru, will never betray

410
30:52.900 --> 30:56.550
the will of my husband and son who fought bloody battles on the battlefield,

411
30:56.550 --> 30:58.440
and I will never disgrace

412
30:58.500 --> 31:01.680
the heroic and loyal names of the Yu and Zhao families.

413
31:02.480 --> 31:04.280
May the ancestors be my witness.

414
31:18.190 --> 31:21.370
[Letter Calling for Surrender]

415
31:35.440 --> 31:36.500
Close the door!

416
31:58.230 --> 32:03.110
[Memorial Tablet of Beloved Son, Yu Mingxuan]

417
31:59.440 --> 32:00.830
Pingjun, my child.

418
32:01.980 --> 32:04.660
I was shocked to hear that the Japanese invaders broke into the city

419
32:04.660 --> 32:07.120
and imprisoned our folks in Yu's Residence.

420
32:08.000 --> 32:10.350
My father taught me since childhood

421
32:10.880 --> 32:14.420
that a general of a city must never abandon the people.

422
32:15.590 --> 32:17.610
My husband and my son

423
32:18.330 --> 32:19.930
are both on the battlefield,

424
32:20.110 --> 32:22.910
defending the country with their flesh and blood.

425
32:23.290 --> 32:25.670
As the matriarch of the Yu family

426
32:25.830 --> 32:27.590
and a daughter of the Zhao family,

427
32:27.590 --> 32:29.720
how can I save only myself

428
32:29.810 --> 32:33.140
and leave the people of the city to suffer?

429
32:34.610 --> 32:36.320
Do not look for me.

430
32:36.510 --> 32:38.000
Your safety

431
32:38.530 --> 32:40.960
is my greatest comfort.

432
32:41.440 --> 32:42.680
Please don't let

433
32:42.680 --> 32:45.790
my last wish be in vain.

434
32:46.960 --> 32:48.200
In this life,

435
32:48.720 --> 32:51.200
I'm truly content to have

436
32:51.740 --> 32:53.510
such great children.

437
32:54.310 --> 32:56.170
If fate allows it in the next life,

438
32:56.430 --> 32:58.900
may we be family once more.

439
33:00.270 --> 33:02.960
Final words from your mother,

440
33:03.350 --> 33:04.610
Baoru.

441
33:45.310 --> 33:46.770
Go up there, hurry!

442
33:46.790 --> 33:48.140
Hurry up! Hurry up!

443
33:56.290 --> 33:56.960
Changxuan.

444
33:58.220 --> 33:58.770
Father!

445
33:59.400 --> 34:00.330
Why are you here?

446
34:00.550 --> 34:01.770
Those damn Japanese

447
34:02.220 --> 34:04.140
bombed my headquarters!

448
34:26.670 --> 34:27.530
Advance!

449
34:53.500 --> 34:54.130
Fire!

450
34:54.130 --> 34:54.710
Commander-in-Chief!

451
34:54.710 --> 34:55.440
Deputy Commander!

452
34:55.440 --> 34:55.960
The Third Company

453
34:55.960 --> 34:57.120
can't hold on much longer at the base camp.

454
34:57.120 --> 34:59.380
A gap has been torn in the defensive line!

455
34:59.630 --> 35:00.210
Got it!

456
35:05.210 --> 35:06.010
I'm old.

457
35:06.400 --> 35:07.530
I can't run anymore.

458
35:07.800 --> 35:08.670
You're the only one who can go.

459
35:08.670 --> 35:09.460
But this is where the Japanese army's

460
35:09.460 --> 35:10.510
firepower is most concentrated.

461
35:10.510 --> 35:11.650
How can I leave you behind?

462
35:11.650 --> 35:13.380
But the base camp is important.

463
35:13.480 --> 35:14.590
Our ammunition,

464
35:14.590 --> 35:15.090
our supplies,

465
35:15.090 --> 35:16.510
everything is there.

466
35:16.630 --> 35:18.030
If you don't go, who will?

467
35:22.460 --> 35:23.260
I am now

468
35:23.670 --> 35:25.980
ordering you in the name of the Commander-in-Chief.

469
35:25.980 --> 35:28.440
Hurry up and take your men to reinforce them!

470
35:32.010 --> 35:32.590
Go!

471
35:38.210 --> 35:39.050
Hang in there!

472
36:00.000 --> 36:00.730
Changxuan!

473
36:04.840 --> 36:05.500
Remember!

474
36:07.110 --> 36:08.370
Since you were a child,

475
36:09.090 --> 36:10.840
you have always been my pride!

476
37:10.840 --> 37:11.590
Director Gu!

477
37:11.710 --> 37:13.190
The Japanese tanks are approaching.

478
37:13.190 --> 37:14.390
Let's retreat first!

479
37:25.090 --> 37:26.090
We can't retreat!

480
37:26.130 --> 37:28.390
If we retreat, the flank will be exposed!

481
37:28.610 --> 37:30.320
Take the remaining men and go first.

482
37:30.320 --> 37:31.130
I'm not leaving!

483
37:31.130 --> 37:32.210
This is an order!

484
37:32.360 --> 37:33.090
Retreat!

485
37:50.050 --> 37:50.710
Commander.

486
37:50.780 --> 37:51.980
We're out of bullets.

487
37:52.380 --> 37:53.060
Men!

488
37:53.510 --> 37:54.710
Attach the bayonets!

489
38:29.590 --> 38:30.340
Everyone.

490
38:33.070 --> 38:34.460
To stand with you all

491
38:35.280 --> 38:36.550
and defend our country

492
38:37.840 --> 38:40.300
is the greatest honor for me, Yu Changxuan.

493
38:41.210 --> 38:42.460
As soldiers,

494
38:44.130 --> 38:45.860
we must protect our land.

495
38:47.650 --> 38:49.310
We shall stand our ground here

496
38:50.440 --> 38:52.170
and fight to the death!

497
38:52.940 --> 38:54.210
China

498
38:56.110 --> 38:58.460
will not perish!

499
39:00.650 --> 39:01.510
Kill!

500
39:01.590 --> 39:02.650
Kill!

501
39:04.280 --> 39:07.550
Kill!

502
39:07.610 --> 39:09.050
Charge!

503
39:18.730 --> 39:21.360
Kill!

504
40:35.690 --> 40:37.710
Japanese invaders!

505
40:37.780 --> 40:39.480
Open your damn eyes

506
40:39.480 --> 40:41.530
and watch closely!

507
40:42.440 --> 40:45.070
We will never surrender, even in death!

508
40:46.480 --> 40:48.110
This is Chinese territory.

509
40:48.420 --> 40:51.730
You will not take a single step into it!

510
41:39.630 --> 41:40.440
Changxuan.

511
41:43.550 --> 41:44.610
Changxuan.

512
42:03.590 --> 42:07.300
Thank you, Bodhisattva, for blessing his safe return from the battlefield.

513
42:07.300 --> 42:08.340
Otherwise,

514
42:08.800 --> 42:09.980
I wouldn't have had a chance

515
42:09.980 --> 42:11.320
to thank him in person.

516
42:11.860 --> 42:14.130
I came specially to give thanks for my answered prayers.

517
42:14.130 --> 42:15.210
From now on,

518
42:15.210 --> 42:16.440
may we both be well.

519
42:17.670 --> 42:19.400
May all his endeavors prosper.

520
42:31.190 --> 42:32.900
The world can be callous,

521
42:34.340 --> 42:35.600
but you're different.

522
42:36.280 --> 42:37.540
You wield great power,

523
42:39.210 --> 42:41.610
yet you've never let it corrupt your heart.

524
42:43.940 --> 42:45.420
I clearly understand

525
42:46.280 --> 42:47.460
the kind of person

526
42:48.500 --> 42:50.070
you are now.

527
42:51.280 --> 42:52.530
I know even better

528
42:53.260 --> 42:54.210
the feelings

529
42:54.650 --> 42:55.590
we have

530
42:55.590 --> 42:57.250
for each other at this moment.

531
42:58.840 --> 42:59.880
Yu Changxuan.

532
43:04.820 --> 43:07.150
I want to spend the rest of my life with you.

533
43:19.960 --> 43:21.300
You must remember,

534
43:23.500 --> 43:25.190
no matter what happens,

535
43:26.170 --> 43:27.530
you are never alone.

536
43:30.050 --> 43:31.850
I will always stand by your side.

537
44:15.760 --> 44:17.570
The soldiers go through rugged terrain,

538
44:17.570 --> 44:19.090
so the stitches must be sturdy.

539
44:19.090 --> 44:19.710
Yes.

540
44:19.940 --> 44:21.210
Especially the pant cuffs.

541
44:21.210 --> 44:22.740
I need to sew them securely.

542
44:29.840 --> 44:30.530
Pingjun.

543
44:32.510 --> 44:33.470
These articles of yours

544
44:33.470 --> 44:34.380
are brilliant.

545
44:34.530 --> 44:35.190
We plan to

546
44:35.190 --> 44:36.530
print and distribute more of them.

547
44:36.530 --> 44:37.590
The reasoning is thorough,

548
44:37.590 --> 44:38.960
and the tone is close to the heart.

549
44:38.960 --> 44:40.050
The villagers can understand them,

550
44:40.050 --> 44:41.860
and the soldiers are very motivated after reading them.

551
44:41.860 --> 44:42.660
That's right.

552
44:43.010 --> 44:44.280
Given the tense situation right now,

553
44:44.280 --> 44:45.610
we need articles like these

554
44:45.610 --> 44:46.780
to mobilize the masses

555
44:46.780 --> 44:47.650
and strengthen their confidence.

556
44:47.650 --> 44:48.400
Exactly.

557
44:50.980 --> 44:51.800
Jinxuan,

558
44:51.980 --> 44:52.760
Minru,

559
44:52.840 --> 44:54.010
thank you too.

560
44:54.090 --> 44:55.110
You both played a part

561
44:55.110 --> 44:56.640
in the logistical support.

562
44:56.780 --> 44:57.860
Don't say that.

563
44:58.190 --> 45:00.340
If you hadn't driven away the bandits,

564
45:00.710 --> 45:01.510
refugees

565
45:01.510 --> 45:02.960
with families like us

566
45:03.340 --> 45:05.000
wouldn't know what we'd face.

567
45:05.480 --> 45:06.130
Yes.

568
45:06.840 --> 45:09.380
Being able to help you

569
45:09.630 --> 45:11.590
makes us happy and relieved.

570
45:11.880 --> 45:13.800
Hanzhi, Wenbo.

571
45:14.800 --> 45:15.670
We should be

572
45:15.880 --> 45:16.840
most grateful to see that

573
45:16.840 --> 45:18.040
the children can play

574
45:18.050 --> 45:19.910
in a safe and secure environment.

575
45:20.760 --> 45:22.000
I hope days like this

576
45:23.000 --> 45:24.010
will become

577
45:24.710 --> 45:26.170
more common and ordinary.

578
45:46.000 --> 45:46.840
Mom,

579
45:46.840 --> 45:47.730
when will this little tree

580
45:47.730 --> 45:50.000
grow up?

581
45:52.090 --> 45:53.630
As long as you take good care of it,

582
45:53.630 --> 45:55.170
it will grow up soon.

583
45:56.010 --> 45:58.010
Dad promised us

584
45:58.010 --> 46:00.320
that we would plant trees together.

585
46:00.320 --> 46:02.820
When will he come back?

586
46:09.260 --> 46:10.130
Yu,

587
46:11.340 --> 46:12.960
as long as the maple leaves of this tree

588
46:12.960 --> 46:14.110
turn red,

589
46:15.000 --> 46:16.730
Dad will definitely come back.

590
46:30.550 --> 46:38.990
[Prayer]

591
46:44.560 --> 46:48.070
[Prayer]
